cquiring images in this central swath of the images.  The processing pipelines will be updated to fill this gap with the IR10 data  for some products. The 3-color coverage is now reduced in width.t\u0000\u0003721t\u0000\u0003allt\u0000\u001F,http\://hirise.lpl.arizona.edu,sr\u0000\u0010java.lang.Double\u0080\u00B3\u00C2J)k\u00FB\u0004\u0002\u0000\u0001D\u0000\u0005valuexq\u0000~\u0000\u0007?\u00F0\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000t\u0000\rHiRISE Stampssr\u0000\u0013java.util.ArrayListx\u0081\u00D2\u001D\u0099\u00C7a\u009D\u0003\u0000\u0001I\u0000\u0004sizexp\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0006w\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0006q\u0000~\u0000Bt\u0000\nproduct_idt\u0000\u001Cspacecraft_clock_start_countt\u0000\u000Fcenter_latitudet\u0000\nlocal_timet\u0000\u000Fspatial_summingxsq\u0000~\u0000O\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000w\u0004\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0000xt\u0000\u0006HiRISEt\u0000\u0006HiRISEt\u0000\u0005stampq\u0000~\u0000\u0018t\u0000\u0012HiRISE Full Stampsq\u0000~\u0000\u0018pq\u0000~\u00004ppt\u0002\u00EBStampFetcher?limit\=2000000&instrument\=HiRISE_Full&viewArea\=106.612,-50.136,106.612,-50.136,106.611,-50.133,106.609,-50.130,106.608,-50.126,106.607,-50.123,106.605,-50.119,106.604,-50.116,106.602,-50.113,106.601,-50.109,106.600,-50.106,106.598,-50.103,106.608,-50.101,106.618,-50.099,106.628,-50.098,106.637,-50.096,106.647,-50.094,106.657,-50.093,106.667,-50.091,106.676,-50.090,106.686,-50.088,106.696,-50.086,106.696,-50.086,106.697,-50.090,106.699,-50.093,106.700,-50.096,106.701,-50.100,106.703,-50.103,106.704,-50.107,106.705,-50.110,106.707,-50.113,106.708,-50.117,106.709,-50.120,106.700,-50.122,106.690,-50.123,106.680,-50.125,106.671,-50.127,106.661,-50.128,106.651,-50.130,106.641,-50.131,106.632,-50.133,106.622,-50.135,106.612,-50.136,sq\u0000~\u0000\u0003\u0000ppppur\u0000.[Ledu.asu.jmars.layer.stamp.FilledStamp$State;\u00BF]p@^l\u0090\u0097\u0002\u0000\u0000xp\u0000\u0000\u0000\u0005sr\u00004edu.asu.jmars.layer.stamp.FilledStampImageType$State\u00DE\u00BFaa\u0017\u0013\u0093\u